<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_only" data-section-id="pg112_sec001" class="bg-white text-zinc-800"><div class="w-full bg-purple-500"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8"><div class="flex items-end gap-6 max-sm:gap-4"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-24 w-24 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-400 text-white shadow-sm max-sm:h-20 max-sm:w-20">&#x1f343;</div><div class="flex-1"><h1 data-id="pg112_n0002" class="adt-h1 font-bold text-white">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1><h2 data-id="pg112_n0003" class="adt-h2 mt-3 border-b-4 border-purple-200 pb-2 font-semibold text-white">Ndotja e uj&#xeb;rave</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-10"><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg112_n0005">Mali vizitonte dajat e tij &#xe7;do pushim pranveror.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0006">Aq shum&#xeb; e donte natyr&#xeb;n e fshatit, saq&#xeb; nuk pranonte kurrsesi t&#xeb; kalonte diku tjet&#xeb;r pushimet.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0007">&#xc7;do gj&#xeb; i dukej e mrekullueshme n&#xeb; fshat: relievi, harmonia e njer&#xeb;zve, lidhja e tyre me natyr&#xeb;n, m&#xeb;nyra se si e punonin tok&#xeb;n, produktet q&#xeb; merrnin nga toka.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0008">E vetmja gj&#xeb; q&#xeb; e shqet&#xeb;sonte ishte lumi i fshatit.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0009" class="italic">Pse banor&#xeb;t hidhnin mbeturina n&#xeb; lum&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0010" class="italic">Pse banor&#xeb;t nuk pastronin lumin nj&#xeb;her&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rgjithmon&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0011" class="italic">Pse fshatar&#xeb;t nuk shp&#xeb;tonin nga kund&#xeb;rmimi i er&#xeb;s s&#xeb; keqe q&#xeb; shkaktonin mbeturinat?</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0012">Mali e kishte kuptuar se tanim&#xeb; nuk ishte i vog&#xeb;l p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dha.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0013">Ai kishte plot shok&#xeb; n&#xeb; fshat me t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t luante.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0014">Mali dha iden&#xeb; i pari q&#xeb; t&#xeb; shkonin s&#xeb; bashku me shok&#xeb;t p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i larguar t&#xeb; gjitha letrat q&#xeb; ishin af&#xeb;r lumit.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0015" class="italic">Po sikur t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkojm&#xeb; ndihm&#xeb; nga t&#xeb; rriturit p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;t&#xeb; gj&#xeb;, &#xe7;far&#xeb; do t&#xeb; na thoshin?</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0016">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t, q&#xeb; mezi prisnin t&#xeb; kalonin koh&#xeb;n s&#xeb; bashku, than&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; nj&#xeb;z&#xeb;ri: &#x201c;Le ta provojm&#xeb;!&#x201d;.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0017">Mali me shoqen e tij, Er&#xeb;n, nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po mblidhnin mbeturinat bashk&#xeb; me fshatar&#xeb;t, po bisedonin se sa keq ishin ndier kur kishin kaluar pushimet n&#xeb; det vitin e kaluar.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0018">Ata kishin par&#xeb; q&#xeb; deti ishte i mbushur me qeska najloni e mbetje ushqimesh.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0019">Nuk arrinin t&#xeb; gjenin dot nj&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjigje p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;to veprime.</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0020">Uji, elementi ky&#xe7; i jet&#xeb;s s&#xeb; gjallesave, a mos &#xeb;sht&#xeb; duke u ndotur shum&#xeb; nga njeriu?</span> <span data-id="pg112_n0021" class="italic">&quot;Njeriu duhet t&#xeb; ndaloj&#xeb; s&#xeb; b&#xeb;ri k&#xeb;to veprime t&#xeb; d&#xeb;mshme&quot;, - ishin fjal&#xeb;t e Yllit, i cili nd&#xeb;rpreu bised&#xeb;n e Malit dhe t&#xeb; Er&#xeb;s.</span></p></div></section></div>
